flowchart TD
    box_0(["Start"])
    box_1{"Does the part meet quality assurance team product<br/>specifications?"}
    box_2["Check product dimensions and inspect for<br/>contamination."]
    box_3["Remove the non conforming parts and reload with a<br/>product batch that meets quality assurance team<br/>specifications."]
    box_4{"Is picking up 4x part from indexing table correct?"}
    box_5["Verify that the part is picked up centred and held<br/>firmly enough in the vacuum head."]
    box_6[/"Indexing table 4x pickup diagnostic (GRAPH 14)"/]
    box_7{"Does the reorientation mechanism rotate correctly<br/>towards part placement position?"}
    box_8["Verify that the reorientation mechanism is level in<br/>both the X and Y axes and that all fixtures are free<br/>of contamination."]
    box_9[/"Reorientation mechanism rotation to part placement<br/>position: diagnostic procedure reference."/]
    box_10{"Are there contaminated parts?"}
    box_11["Complete the following checks: 1. Check whether the<br/>vacuum end effectors are contaminated. 2. Check<br/>whether the assembly robot axes are contaminated."]
    box_12["Clean the contaminated vacuum end effectors and<br/>assembly robot axes."]
    box_13[/"Assembly robot axis lubrication procedure"/]
    box_14{"Are there electrical defects?"}
    box_15["Complete the following checks: 1. Check cabling and<br/>upper displacement sensors on the vacuum end<br/>effectors. 2. Check whether the vacuum switches turn<br/>off vacuum when placing. 3. Check whether the valve<br/>for the vacuum generator works correctly. 4. Check<br/>system settings on the operator control interface."]
    box_16["Replace the defective cabling and/or displacement<br/>sensor on the vacuum end effectors."]
    box_17{"Are there worn parts?"}
    box_18["Complete the following checks: 1. Check wear on the<br/>vacuum end effectors. 2. Check wear on the actuator<br/>grippers. 3. Check wear on the guide axis through<br/>the ball recirculation bushing. 4. Check the<br/>assembly robot axes for wear."]
    box_19["Replace the worn components identified in the<br/>inspection (vacuum end effectors, actuator grippers,<br/>guide axis, and/or assembly robot axes)."]
    box_20[/"Assembly robot replacement procedure"/]
    box_21{"Is the z parallelism of the lower position of 4x<br/>gripper relative to each other correct?"}
    box_22[/"Refer to the Z parallelism of 4x gripper lower<br/>position for variant A machines (small format<br/>parts)."/]
    box_23[/"Refer to the Z parallelism of 4x gripper lower<br/>position for variant B machines (medium format<br/>parts)."/]
    box_24[/"Refer to the Z parallelism of 4x gripper lower<br/>position for variant C machines (large format<br/>parts)."/]
    box_25["Readjust the Z parallelism of the 4x gripper lower<br/>positions to the specified tolerance."]
    box_26{"Is the center to center assembly robot gripper<br/>relative to reorientation mechanism correct?"}
    box_27[/"Refer to the gripper center to center distance<br/>relative to reorientation mechanism for variant A<br/>machines (small format parts)."/]
    box_28[/"Refer to the gripper center to center distance<br/>relative to reorientation mechanism for variant B<br/>machines (medium format parts)."/]
    box_29[/"Refer to the gripper center to center distance<br/>relative to reorientation mechanism for variant C<br/>machines (large format parts)."/]
    box_30["Readjust the center to center distance of the 4x<br/>gripper assembly relative to the reorientation<br/>mechanism to the specified value."]
    box_31{"Is the part placement position in the reorientation<br/>unit correct?"}
    box_32[/"Refer to the XYZ placement position check for<br/>variant A machines (small format parts)."/]
    box_33[/"Refer to the XYZ placement position check for<br/>variant B machines (medium format parts)."/]
    box_34[/"Refer to the XYZ placement position check for<br/>variant C machines (large format parts)."/]
    box_35["Perform assembly robot calibrations to correct the<br/>XYZ part placement position in the reorientation<br/>unit."]
    box_36["Restart this diagnostic procedure from the<br/>beginning."]
    box_37(["Placing 4x part in reorientation unit is correct"])

